4. BSIM4 4.8.3 (UC Berkeley BSIM Research Group)
------------------------------------------------

The BSIM4 model of Dune (crates/dune-core/src/bsim4/) is a translation
into Rust of BSIM4 version 4.8.3 as distributed with ngspice-47
(src/spicelib/devices/bsim4/: b4.c, b4mpar.c, b4par.c, b4set.c,
b4temp.c, b4geo.c, b4check.c, b4ld.c, b4acld.c, b4pzld.c, b4noi.c,
b4cvtest.c, b4trunc.c, b4getic.c, bsim4def.h). The Rust files are
modified versions of those files: the C was translated statement by
statement; global state, the OpenMP and KLU paths and the bypass were
removed; ngspice's circuit and matrix data structures were replaced by
Dune's. Each Rust file states this and reproduces the upstream notice,
which reads:

    BSIM4 4.8.3 released on 05/19/2025
    BSIM4 Model Equations

