Only version 4.8.3 is used. The older BSIM4 code bases that ngspice
also carries (bsim4v5, bsim4v6, bsim4v7) are not part of Dune. The
test decks corpus/regress/bsim4_*.cir use model cards written for
Dune. BSIM3 and BSIM4 are compiled only with the `bsim` cargo feature
of dune-core (on by default); a build without it contains neither.

